      <li itemprop="itemListElement" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/ListItem">
        <a href="/" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.3);text-decoration:none;" itemprop="item"><span itemprop="name">Home</span></a>
        <meta itemprop="position" content="1" />
      </li>
      <li style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.18);">/</li>
      <li itemprop="itemListElement" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/ListItem">
        <a href="/tools" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.3);text-decoration:none;" itemprop="item"><span itemprop="name">Free Tools</span></a>
        <meta itemprop="position" content="2" />
      </li>
      <li style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.18);">/</li>
      <li itemprop="itemListElement" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/ListItem">
        <span style="color:#fff;" itemprop="name">Production Timeline Calculator</span>
        <meta itemprop="position" content="3" />
      </li>
    </ol>
  </nav>

  <div class="tool-hero">
    <span class="section-label">Free Tool — No Signup Required</span>
    <h1>Apparel Production Timeline Calculator</h1>
    <p class="sub">The single biggest reason clothing brands miss their launch is not knowing when to start. Most brands underestimate total production time by 30–60 days. Enter your target launch date and this tool reverse-engineers every deadline — tech pack, sampling, bulk production, and shipment — so you never miss a season again.</p>
    <div class="trust-row">
      <span class="trust-item">Reverse-engineer from launch date</span>
      <span class="trust-item">OEM, ODM, CMT &amp; private label</span>
      <span class="trust-item">Sea &amp; air freight included</span>
      <span class="trust-item">Urgency alerts built in</span>
    </div>
