    <p class="disclaimer">Timeline estimates are based on SDF Clothing's standard production schedule from Dhaka, Bangladesh. Actual dates depend on tech pack completeness, fabric availability, sample approval speed, and confirmed order. Sea freight is 38–45 days from Chittagong port; air freight is 5–7 days from Dhaka airport. Add 3–7 days buffer for customs clearance at destination. All timelines assume weekday working days excluding Bangladesh public holidays.</p>
  </div>

  <!-- SEO BODY CONTENT -->
  <div class="seo-content">

    <h2>How Long Does Clothing Production Take From Bangladesh?</h2>
    <p>One of the most common mistakes new clothing brands make is dramatically underestimating production lead time. A standard OEM order of 500–2,000 pieces from Bangladesh takes <strong style="color:#fff;">approximately 90 days</strong> from tech pack confirmation to goods arriving at your warehouse by sea freight. Breaking that down:</p>

    <table class="lt-table" aria-label="Clothing production lead time breakdown">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Stage</th>
          <th>Who acts</th>
          <th>Typical duration</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>Tech pack review &amp; order confirmation</td><td>Buyer + Factory</td><td>3–5 days</td></tr>
        <tr><td>30% deposit payment</td><td>Buyer</td><td>1–2 days</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Proto / first sample production</td><td>Factory (SDF)</td><td>12–18 days</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Buyer review &amp; revision feedback</td><td>Buyer</td><td>5–7 days</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Pre-production sample (PP sample)</td><td>Factory (SDF)</td><td>7–10 days</td></tr>
        <tr><td>PP sample sign-off</td><td>Buyer</td><td>3–5 days</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Bulk cut &amp; sew production</td><td>Factory (SDF)</td><td>30–50 days</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Final QC, packing &amp; export docs</td><td>Factory (SDF)</td><td>3–5 days</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Sea freight (Chittagong → destination)</td><td>Freight forwarder</td><td>38–45 days</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Customs clearance at destination</td><td>Buyer's broker</td><td>3–7 days</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <p>ODM and private label orders are faster because SDF already has base patterns and fabric relationships. CMT orders skip fabric sourcing delays. The timeline calculator above adjusts for all of these scenarios automatically.</p>

    <h2>What Is the Critical Path in Apparel Production?</h2>
    <p>The <strong style="color:#fff;">critical path</strong> is the sequence of steps where any delay pushes back the entire delivery. In apparel production, the most common bottlenecks are:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong style="color:#fff;">Incomplete tech pack</strong> — factories cannot start without measurements, construction details, BOM, and artwork. This is the single biggest cause of delays for new brands</li>
      <li><strong style="color:#fff;">Slow sample approval</strong> — every extra round of revisions adds 14–21 days to your timeline</li>
      <li><strong style="color:#fff;">Custom fabric lead time</strong> — special fabrics (custom dye colours, unique weaves, certified organic) require 20–30 days just for fabric production before cutting can begin</li>
      <li><strong style="color:#fff;">Late payment</strong> — factories do not begin production until the deposit is cleared. Bank transfer delays cost 2–5 days</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Seasonal Production Deadlines — When to Start</h2>
    <p>If you are targeting a specific retail season, use these rough start dates for sea freight from Bangladesh. These are the <strong style="color:#fff;">latest possible</strong> dates to submit your tech pack and begin production:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong style="color:#fff;">Christmas / Holiday (Dec 1st in-hand, USA):</strong> Tech pack by July 10th at the latest</li>
      <li><strong style="color:#fff;">Spring / Summer drop (Mar 1st in-hand, Europe):</strong> Tech pack by November 10th</li>
      <li><strong style="color:#fff;">Back to School (Aug 1st in-hand, USA):</strong> Tech pack by April 5th</li>
      <li><strong style="color:#fff;">Black Friday (Nov 15th in-hand, USA):</strong> Tech pack by June 20th</li>
    </ul>
    <p>The calculator above gives you exact dates for your specific launch date and production type.</p>

    <h2>OEM vs ODM vs CMT vs Private Label — Which Is Right for You?</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong style="color:#fff;">OEM</strong> — You design everything, provide tech packs. Full control, longest lead time. Best for established brands with in-house design capability</li>
      <li><strong style="color:#fff;">ODM</strong> — SDF provides base designs you modify and brand. Faster sampling, lower development cost. Best for brands scaling quickly without a dedicated design team</li>
      <li><strong style="color:#fff;">CMT</strong> — You source and ship fabric to SDF; SDF cuts, sews, and finishes. Lower CM cost but you bear fabric sourcing risk</li>
      <li><strong style="color:#fff;">Private Label</strong> — SDF has ready styles; you add your label. Fastest route to market. Best for first-time brands testing demand before investing in custom design</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

    <div style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);padding-bottom:1.25rem;margin-bottom:1.25rem;">
      <h3 style="margin-top:0;">Can SDF Clothing expedite production for urgent orders?</h3>
      <p>Yes, subject to capacity availability. SDF offers priority production slots for urgent orders at a surcharge. Contact us immediately if your timeline is under 60 days — expedited orders require air freight and carry a higher per-unit cost. Use our <a href="/tools/garment-cost-calculator" style="color:#e00;" title="Garment cost calculator">Garment Cost Calculator</a> to see the air vs sea freight cost difference.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);padding-bottom:1.25rem;margin-bottom:1.25rem;">
      <h3 style="margin-top:0;">What happens if I do not approve the sample on time?</h3>
      <p>Any delay in sample approval directly delays bulk production start. Each week of delay pushes your ex-factory date by one week. If you are approaching a seasonal deadline, SDF will flag this and recommend switching to air freight to recover transit time — though this increases your unit cost.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="padding-bottom:1.25rem;">
      <h3 style="margin-top:0;">What other free tools does SDF offer for clothing brands?</h3>
      <p>SDF provides a full suite of free planning tools including a <a href="/tools/garment-cost-calculator" style="color:#e00;" title="Garment cost calculator">Garment Cost Calculator</a>, a <a href="/tools/manufacturer-email-generator" style="color:#e00;" title="Manufacturer email generator">Manufacturer Email Generator</a>, an <a href="/tools/aql-calculator" style="color:#e00;" title="AQL calculator">AQL Calculator</a>, a <a href="/tools/gsm-converter" style="color:#e00;" title="GSM converter">GSM to OZ Converter</a>, and more. All free, no signup.</p>
    </div>

  </div>

</div>

<script>
function addDays(d,n){ const x=new Date(d); x.setDate(x.getDate()+n); return x; }
function subDays(d,n){ const x=new Date(d); x.setDate(x.getDate()-n); return x; }
function fmtFull(d){ return d.toLocaleDateString('en-GB',{day:'numeric',month:'short',year:'numeric'}); }
function fmtShort(d){ return d.toLocaleDateString('en-GB',{day:'numeric',month:'short'}); }
function daysBetween(a,b){ return Math.round((b-a)/(1000*60*60*24)); }

function buildTimeline(){
  const launchVal = document.getElementById('launch-date').value;
  if(!launchVal){ alert('Please select your target launch date.'); return; }

  const launch   = new Date(launchVal);
  const svc      = document.getElementById('service-type').value;
  const qty      = document.getElementById('order-qty').value;
  const shipMode = document.getElementById('ship-mode').value;
  const today    = new Date(); today.setHours(0,0,0,0);

  const freightDays = shipMode==='air'?7:43;
  const customsDays = 5;
  const prodDays = {small:30,medium:40,large:52,xlarge:68}[qty];
  const sampleDays = (svc==='odm'||svc==='private')?13:18;
  const ppDays = svc==='cmt'?0:10;
  const ppReviewDays = svc==='cmt'?0:5;
  const buyerReviewDays = 7;
  const confirmDays = 4;
  const techPackDays = (svc==='oem'||svc==='cmt')?3:0;

  const totalDays = techPackDays+confirmDays+sampleDays+buyerReviewDays+ppDays+ppReviewDays+prodDays+freightDays+customsDays;

  // Work backward from launch
  const custClear  = subDays(launch, 0);
  const portArr    = subDays(custClear, customsDays);
  const shipDepart = subDays(portArr, freightDays);
  const exFactory  = subDays(shipDepart, 3);
  const bulkEnd    = subDays(exFactory, 0);
  const bulkStart  = subDays(bulkEnd, prodDays);
  const ppApprove  = subDays(bulkStart, ppReviewDays);
  const ppReady    = subDays(ppApprove, ppDays);
  const protoApprove = ppDays>0 ? subDays(ppReady, buyerReviewDays) : subDays(bulkStart, buyerReviewDays);
  const protoReady = subDays(protoApprove, sampleDays);
  const orderConfirm = subDays(protoReady, confirmDays);
  const techPackDue = subDays(orderConfirm, techPackDays+1);
  const startDate = svc==='oem'||svc==='cmt' ? techPackDue : orderConfirm;

  const daysToStart = daysBetween(today, startDate);
  const daysToLaunch = daysBetween(today, launch);

  // Alert
  let alertHtml = '';
  if(daysToStart<0){
    alertHtml=`<div class="alert alert-red" role="alert">⚠ Your start deadline has already passed by ${Math.abs(daysToStart)} days. Air freight may recover some time but will increase your unit cost significantly. Contact SDF immediately for a fast-track assessment.</div>`;
  } else if(daysToStart<=14){
    alertHtml=`<div class="alert alert-yellow" role="alert">⚡ You need to start in ${daysToStart} days. This is a tight window. Contact SDF today to check production slot availability and consider air freight.</div>`;
  } else {
    alertHtml=`<div class="alert alert-green" role="alert">✓ Your timeline is achievable. Start no later than <strong>${fmtFull(startDate)}</strong> to hit your launch date.</div>`;
  }
  document.getElementById('alert-box').innerHTML = alertHtml;

  // Summary
  document.getElementById('s-start').textContent = fmtShort(startDate);
  document.getElementById('s-lead').textContent = totalDays+' days';
  document.getElementById('s-launch').textContent = fmtShort(launch);

  // Build milestones
  const tagMap = {sdf:'SDF Action',buyer:'Your Action',ship:'Logistics',target:'Launch'};
  const ms = [];

  if(svc==='oem'||svc==='cmt'){
    ms.push({ date:techPackDue, title:'Submit Tech Pack / Spec Sheet', desc:'Send complete tech pack with measurements, construction notes, BOM, fabric spec, and artwork files. Incomplete tech packs are the #1 cause of production delays.', tag:'buyer', dot:today>techPackDue?'done':daysToStart<=7?'warn':'now' });
  }
  ms.push({ date:orderConfirm, title:'Order Confirmation + 30% Deposit', desc:'Confirm final quantity, colourway, size ratio, incoterms, and payment of deposit. Factory does not begin sampling until deposit is cleared.', tag:'buyer', dot:today>orderConfirm?'done':'now' });
  ms.push({ date:protoReady, title:'Proto / First Sample Ready', desc:`SDF delivers first prototype sample for fit, construction, and fabric review. ${svc==='odm'||svc==='private'?'Based on SDF base pattern — faster turnaround.':'Based on your tech pack.'}`, tag:'sdf', dot:today>protoReady?'done':'now' });
  ms.push({ date:protoApprove, title:'Proto Sample Approval', desc:'Review sample, measure against spec, and send written approval or detailed revision comments. Each revision round adds 12–18 days.', tag:'buyer', dot:today>protoApprove?'done':'now' });
  if(ppDays>0){
    ms.push({ date:ppReady, title:'Pre-Production Sample Ready', desc:'Final sample in bulk fabric and confirmed trims. Must match approved proto exactly. This is the sign-off sample for bulk production.', tag:'sdf', dot:today>ppReady?'done':'now' });
    ms.push({ date:ppApprove, title:'PP Sample Sign-Off Required', desc:'Written approval mandatory. Bulk production cannot begin without this. Review within 5 days to avoid delaying bulk start.', tag:'buyer', dot:today>ppApprove?'done':'now' });
  }
  ms.push({ date:bulkStart, title:'Bulk Production Starts', desc:`Fabric cut, sewing lines assigned, trims staged. ${prodDays} production days. SDF production reports shared weekly.`, tag:'sdf', dot:today>bulkStart?'done':'now' });
  ms.push({ date:exFactory, title:'Ex-Factory — Final QC + Packing', desc:'AQL final inspection, carton packing, export documentation. Balance payment (70%) due before shipment release.', tag:'sdf', dot:today>exFactory?'done':'now' });
  ms.push({ date:shipDepart, title: shipMode==='air'?'Air Shipment Departs Dhaka':'Sea Container Departs Chittagong', desc:shipMode==='air'?'Air freight via Dhaka Hazrat Shahjalal Airport. ~5–7 days transit.':'FCL/LCL container from Chittagong. ~40–43 days transit to destination port.', tag:'ship', dot:today>shipDepart?'done':'now' });
  ms.push({ date:launch, title:'🎯 Goods In Hand — Launch Ready', desc:'Goods arrive at destination port, clear customs, and are delivered to your warehouse or 3PL. Ready for launch, retail drop, or Amazon FBA.', tag:'target', dot:'target' });

  let html = '';
  ms.forEach(m=>{
    const urgent = daysBetween(today,m.date)<=7 && today<=m.date;
    html += `<div class="tl-item">
      <div class="tl-dot-col"><div class="tl-dot ${m.dot}"></div></div>
      <div class="tl-body">
        <div class="tl-date${urgent?' urgent':''}">${fmtFull(m.date)}</div>
        <div class="tl-title">${m.title}</div>
        <div class="tl-desc">${m.desc}</div>
        <span class="tl-tag ${m.tag}">${tagMap[m.tag]}</span>
      </div>
    </div>`;
  });
  document.getElementById('timeline').innerHTML = html;

  // CTA
  if(daysToStart<0){
    document.getElementById('cta-text').textContent = 'Your timeline is critical. Contact SDF Clothing immediately — we offer fast-track assessment and air freight solutions for urgent orders.';
  } else {
    document.getElementById('cta-text').textContent = `You need to start by ${fmtFull(startDate)}. SDF Clothing offers ${svc==='odm'||svc==='private'?'13':'14'}-day sample turnaround. Secure your production slot today — we fill up ${totalDays>90?'90':'60'} days ahead of peak season.`;
  }

  const res = document.getElementById('results');
  res.classList.add('visible');
  res.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'start'});
}
</script>

</BaseLayout>
